            {
                "entry_id": "d6deec6f-6c5a-30d1-b699-f3a36377ae52",
                "word": "абы",
                "pos": "particle",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8cce7463-64df-3e6b-91f2-6ce931e99ee6",
                        "entry_id": "d6deec6f-6c5a-30d1-b699-f3a36377ae52",
                        "glosses": [
                            "it doesn't matter (what/which/who/how)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f5da3a2-e2e0-4d9f-aafe-2bf460e255a4",
                                "sense_id": "8cce7463-64df-3e6b-91f2-6ce931e99ee6",
                                "text": "С утра ему́ яи́чко. Да ещё не абы как сва́ренное.",
                                "translation": "In the morning he has an egg. And it matters how it's cooked.",
                                "english": "In the morning he has an egg. And it matters how it's cooked."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b0c4dbd-4609-44d0-86dd-da7aa2411404",
                                "sense_id": "8cce7463-64df-3e6b-91f2-6ce931e99ee6",
                                "text": "Отпра́вить письма мо́жно то́лько через санита́рок, и не абы каки́х, а сердобо́льных, иначе ничего́ не вы́йдет.",
                                "translation": "You can only send letters through the nurses, but not just any but through the (they must be) compassionate ones, otherwise nothing will come of it.",
                                "english": "You can only send letters through the nurses, but not just any but through the (they must be) compassionate ones, otherwise nothing will come of it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "00f6ba68-bdf8-3c41-a58e-c824c96a7b24",
                "word": "абы",
                "pos": "conj",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7bdebb4f-470d-37c2-81cf-d242b88c7dd1",
                        "entry_id": "00f6ba68-bdf8-3c41-a58e-c824c96a7b24",
                        "glosses": [
                            "союз устар., прост. лишь бы, только бы, чтобы"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3964c8a7-0460-4749-903e-c6abb1f38ed1",
                                "sense_id": "7bdebb4f-470d-37c2-81cf-d242b88c7dd1",
                                "text": "За чужим не гонюся, абы своё было цело!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0f0ed15-6034-45ae-8636-0cfc138879a0",
                                "sense_id": "7bdebb4f-470d-37c2-81cf-d242b88c7dd1",
                                "text": "Министры — им что, абы жалованье получать да царю что ни попало подсовывать."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f5b9610e-9d22-341e-a243-f3abb5c7508d",
                        "entry_id": "00f6ba68-bdf8-3c41-a58e-c824c96a7b24",
                        "glosses": [
                            "частица устар., прост. лишь бы, только бы (обычно с оттенком желательности)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "856f1031-b3c4-44a7-93a8-627cab7f31a3",
                                "sense_id": "f5b9610e-9d22-341e-a243-f3abb5c7508d",
                                "text": "Нам абы гро́ши да харчи хоро́ши!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6208cea-7d69-4fbb-9bbc-c600b1a97dde",
                                "sense_id": "f5b9610e-9d22-341e-a243-f3abb5c7508d",
                                "text": "Ему абы блеск в очи, ― все эти стеклярусы, да бархаты, да цимбалы, да вальсы."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "972f27cc-7423-30c1-a109-5e8366d1c025",
                        "entry_id": "00f6ba68-bdf8-3c41-a58e-c824c96a7b24",
                        "glosses": [
                            "частица прост. всё равно, неважно, безразлично"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "в сочетании с местоимениями и местоименными наречиями"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "67d4e516-4418-410b-af86-05d6c6ac5346",
                                "sense_id": "972f27cc-7423-30c1-a109-5e8366d1c025",
                                "text": "Решила родить абы от кого — ну, а тут как раз дурак попался."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9701aabf-73aa-4f03-8474-22f1b64e0b36",
                                "sense_id": "972f27cc-7423-30c1-a109-5e8366d1c025",
                                "text": "Он любил читать, да не абы что, а стихи и философскую литературу."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8a4a0e5-10bd-41b6-b789-fddf8d44295c",
                                "sense_id": "972f27cc-7423-30c1-a109-5e8366d1c025",
                                "text": "Слышала также, что народ здесь подобрался мастеровой, абы кого с улицы не берут, с налёту не доверяются."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "64bfcea1-9398-49b2-a3e5-5e0a8f0fea51",
                        "source_entry_id": "00f6ba68-bdf8-3c41-a58e-c824c96a7b24",
                        "target_lang_word": "provided that",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "provided that",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d704e1c-56dd-3199-88ea-ada97d2040ee",
                                        "entry_id": "29168373-f8d6-31f9-942b-97f434265626",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of provided."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a3e7e099-7a7b-4467-8992-ac8b0127371a",
                        "source_entry_id": "00f6ba68-bdf8-3c41-a58e-c824c96a7b24",
                        "target_lang_word": "as long as",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "as long as",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2627d8ae-679b-31c4-b10a-c5667330401a",
                                        "entry_id": "a69b5240-dc9d-3801-a451-a07833c3fcfe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see as, long."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc3f0515-b0ef-4de2-8362-a33d3a950b5c",
                                                "sense_id": "2627d8ae-679b-31c4-b10a-c5667330401a",
                                                "text": "It took three times as long as I expected (= three times longer than I did)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fff0b07e-4acd-3c5c-99f2-3a7a07b9abaf",
                                        "entry_id": "a69b5240-dc9d-3801-a451-a07833c3fcfe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Provided that, if, assuming (depending upon some condition or requirement)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebf71eb3-ddda-4c88-8e19-1a6fe10037d2",
                                                "sense_id": "fff0b07e-4acd-3c5c-99f2-3a7a07b9abaf",
                                                "text": "I don't mind if he stays there, as long as he cleans up after himself when he's done."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3d6dbcc-8c6a-4f37-aafd-09cb7c786f1f",
                                                "sense_id": "fff0b07e-4acd-3c5c-99f2-3a7a07b9abaf",
                                                "text": "I don't care who you are, where you're from, what you did, as long as you love me"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "809770ad-496a-37b8-aa70-b417880ef9ee",
                                        "entry_id": "a69b5240-dc9d-3801-a451-a07833c3fcfe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "For the entire duration that; while; since."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b51e0f8-21ee-450e-85ae-b80c7088e696",
                                                "sense_id": "809770ad-496a-37b8-aa70-b417880ef9ee",
                                                "text": "As long as you're here, you may as well help me with the garden."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "as long as",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae88fc21-0a12-3d2d-b51b-1c6b65225bc0",
                                        "entry_id": "bc3b4f42-1e83-3302-bd45-ebd23cc37ee4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see as, long."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "178ba44e-0e3c-4ea9-b79b-637e1ed599d6",
                                                "sense_id": "ae88fc21-0a12-3d2d-b51b-1c6b65225bc0",
                                                "text": "These meetings can last as long as three hours."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
